TITLE 1D transport with cation exchange; query CaX2 equivalent fraction at exchange 8, step 4

SOLUTION 0  Inflow
    pH      7.0
    Na      1.0
    Cl      1.0

SOLUTION 1-10  Initial cells
    pH      7.0
    Ca      1.0
    Cl      2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X   0.001
    -equilibrate 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells              10
    -shifts             10
    -time_step          1
    -flow_direction     forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -lengths            1
    -dispersivities     0
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -punch_cells        8
    -punch_frequency    1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false

USER_PUNCH
    -headings step cell eqfrac_CaX2
10 PUNCH STEP_NO, CELL_NO, 2*MOL("CaX2")/TOT("X")

END
